OL,3,AMillions cast ballots in US midterms as
OL,4,Avoter poll suggests majority unhappy
OL,5,Awith economy
OL,6,
OL,7,FVoters across the US name the economy
OL,8,Fand state of democracy as their top
OL,9,Fconcerns as they cast ballots in the
OL,10,Fmidterm elections - read the latest
OL,11,Ffrom a major poll
OL,13,FSome 75% of those asked say the economy
OL,14,Fis "not so good or poor", while 25% say
OL,15,Fit's "excellent or good"
OL,17,FMeanwhile, Americans are still voting
OL,18,Fto determine who will control Congress
OL,19,Ffor the rest of Donald Trump's
OL,20,Fpresidency - when will we get results?
