OL,3,AMillions cast ballots in US midterms as
OL,4,Avoter poll suggests majority unhappy
OL,5,Awith economy
OL,6,
OL,7,FTrump's Republican Party currently
OL,8,Fcontrols the House and the Senate - how
OL,9,Fmany seats must the Democrats win to
OL,10,Ftake control?
OL,12,FIn both Iowa and Ohio, where Senate
OL,13,Fraces are being closely watched, voters
OL,14,Fspeak to the BBC: Marilyn says she
OL,15,F"would not vote for a Democrat" while
OL,16,FTim says the "farm economy" is
OL,17,F"impacting my decision"
